# No local app runs

- Do not start local dev servers (`next dev`, `pnpm dev`, `npm run dev`, Docker compose, etc.) for Jerzyfy.
- Verify changes in the **UAT** or **Prod** environments instead.
- Local static checks (typecheck, lint, unit tests) are still fine.
